T:O Day of Rest And Gladness
T:WOODBIRD
C:Music: traditional German found in "Memminger Tabulaturbuche", 17th Century · Words: Christopher Wordsworth, 1862
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Music can be found in "AltDeutsches Liederbuch", 1877 page 232 song 134. (no arrangement, melody only) Music source: Episcopal Hymnal, 1940, Hymn 474. arrangeme. No second score was available to cross-check the melody.
